    "c37c8925c745c4a43803b5898ac7616026d9985a0ff4e4c4737f9363a25f4874": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "b6c2b2c43dc73bdc68d1b19e3a8dbbbebe71365bd5b37870d6317adbcaaa8db4",
      "contextFingerprint": "b62e827c5bd400c907cbe6d90739ebcb0a0833bbc0fe788ee9ffa2576d151d73",
      "sourceText": "| 工具 | 解决的问题 | 重点 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Lambda | 在使用现场写一个小函数 | 捕获列表、参数、返回值、生命周期 |\n| `std::function` | 统一保存和传递不同类型的可调用对象 | 类型擦除、回调成员变量、回调容器 |\n| `std::bind` | 适配已有函数的参数 | 固定参数、调整顺序、绑定成员函数 |",
      "translatedText": "| Tools | Problem solved | Key points |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Lambda | Write a small function at the point of use | Capture list, parameters, return value, lifetime |\n| `std::function` | Uniformly store and pass callable objects of different types | Type erasure, callback member variables, callback containers |\n| `std::bind` | Adapt the parameters of an existing function | Fixed parameters, adjust order, bind member functions |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
